DESCRIPTION:All Souls' Day falls on November 2 and is the Catholic Church's
  Commemoration of All the Faithful Departed: the day set aside to pray for
  the dead\, as distinct from All Saints' Day the morning before\, which ho
 nors the saints already in heaven. The practice of praying for the dead is
  far older than the date. The date itself is traceable to one Burgundian a
 bbey at the end of the tenth century.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holid
 ay/all-souls-day/
